  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Grate carrot.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d842396bb16e39e1b79c56/step-fcb13400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook carrot, stirring occasionally, until softened, 2-3 mins. Stir in tomato & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add the water and butter and bring to the boil.\n• Stir in couscous. Cover with a lid and remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up couscous with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d842396bb16e39e1b79c56/step-3bbb3910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While couscous is cooking, pat haloumi dry and cut into 1cm slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Cook haloumi in batches for the best results.\n• Remove from heat and add the honey and a splash of water to the pan, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d842396bb16e39e1b79c56/step-07f58220.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add baby spinach, tomato, a squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of vinegar to the couscous. Toss to combine. Season to taste.\n• Divide couscous between bowls. Top with haloumi.\n• Drizzle with Greek-style yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d842396bb16e39e1b79c56/step-4508c230.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
